        <body>
            <div xml:id="d370">

                <pb facs="0497" n="427" xml:id="pg427"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Viscount Treilhard to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of France in the United
                                States</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 8, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The Viscount Treilhard presents his compliments to Mr. Seward, and has the honor
                    to communicate to him the papers, hereunto annexed, referring to a Frenchman
                    whose funds are held in custody in consequence of a conflict of authority
                    between Mr. Reverdy Johnson and General Butler.</p>




